# game/Monday.rpy:11
translate ptbr monday_3fc1b0bb:

    # "Yeeyah River feeds Emma Lake from the North."
    "O Rio Yeeyah deságua no Lago Emma ali pelo norte."

# game/Monday.rpy:12
translate ptbr monday_c580bd9c:

    # "It's a farther drive than the lake itself, but it does have a few nice clearings along its edge."
    "Dá um pouco mais de chão do que ir direto pro lago, mas a margem tem uns espaços abertos bem bacanas."

# game/Monday.rpy:13
translate ptbr monday_a73055b2:

    # "One of them has a few benches and a rusted-to-hell public grill that I'm sure no one has used in decades."
    "Um desses espaços tem uns bancos e uma churrasqueira pública enferrujada até a alma que eu aposto que ninguém encosta faz décadas."

# game/Monday.rpy:14
translate ptbr monday_b3e2690e:

    # "This is the place that we go."
    "É pra lá que a gente vai."

# game/Monday.rpy:15
translate ptbr monday_82154881:

    # "As we're unloading Leo's van, I decide to get the b-roll of the lake right away."
    "Enquanto a gente tira as coisas da van do Leo, eu decido já ir gravando as imagens de apoio do lago."

# game/Monday.rpy:16
translate ptbr monday_a8e2edc8:

    # "It won't have much of a presence in the packet, so I think I'm just gonna narrate over it later."
    "Não vai ter muito destaque no material final, então acho que vou só jogar uma narração por cima depois."

# game/Monday.rpy:17
translate ptbr monday_f7eee5ff:

    # "The actual lake is only a few minutes walk from here."
    "O lago mesmo fica a só uns minutinhos de caminhada daqui."

# game/Monday.rpy:18
translate ptbr monday_b3801c4c:

    # "It's a bit difficult navigating around the sage brush, and I know I'm gonna have to check for ticks later."
    "É meio chato desviar desses arbustos secos, e já sei que vou ter que me checar atrás de carrapatos mais tarde."

# game/Monday.rpy:22
translate ptbr monday_22e2915b:

    # "By the time I reach the lake, my friends are pretty far behind me, hidden behind a few bends and hills."
    "Quando eu chego no lago, meus amigos já ficaram bem pra trás, escondidos por algumas curvas e colinas."

# game/Monday.rpy:24
translate ptbr monday_9cdc374f:

    # "I'm getting uncomfortable with the idea of me holding this camera while I navigate this terrain."
    "Tá me dando uma agonia ter que segurar essa câmera enquanto tento andar por esse terreno."

# game/Monday.rpy:25
translate ptbr monday_783565b2:

    # "It probably would have been better if Leo had just parked the car next to the reservoir while I got out to film, but I guess even that still wasn't okay."
    "Provavelmente teria sido melhor se o Leo só tivesse estacionado o carro do lado da represa enquanto eu saía pra filmar, mas pelo visto nem isso tava de boa."

# game/Monday.rpy:26
translate ptbr monday_ab9122f2:

    # "There's a large square of paved ground next to the parking lot, now, several benches, and a row of brand new grills."
    "Agora tem um grande quadrado de asfalto do lado do estacionamento, vários bancos e uma fileira de churrasqueiras novinhas em folha."

# game/Monday.rpy:27
translate ptbr monday_7210d006:

    # "Several lamps have been erected around the area, too."
    "Também colocaram vários postes de luz em volta da área."

# game/Monday.rpy:28
translate ptbr monday_aaa50115:

    # "Leo was right about the town trying to turn the reservoir into a recreational spot."
    "O Leo tinha razão sobre a cidade estar tentando transformar a represa num ponto de lazer."

# game/Monday.rpy:29
translate ptbr monday_433e7169:

    # "I can actually see a few jet boats skimming through the water, leaving long trails of white behind them."
    "Eu até consigo ver algumas lanchas cortando a água e deixando uns rastros brancos enormes pra trás."

# game/Monday.rpy:30
translate ptbr monday_007868c5:

    # "There's even what looks like a feline of some sort fishing in the shallows."
    "Tem até o que parece ser algum tipo de felino pescando na parte mais rasa."

# game/Monday.rpy:31
translate ptbr monday_5c62e07c:

    # "It would explain why the motel is still in business."
    "Isso explicaria por que o motel ainda não faliu."

# game/Monday.rpy:32
translate ptbr monday_b6b1ee84:

    # "Lake Emma is fairly small, only about twelve miles long and five wide."
    "O Lago Emma é bem pequeno, tem só uns dezenove quilômetros de comprimento por oito de largura."

# game/Monday.rpy:33
translate ptbr monday_8690d899:

    # "I look around before climbing to the top of a nearby hill and get my shots."
    "Dou uma olhada em volta antes de subir no topo de uma colina ali perto pra gravar minhas imagens."

# game/Monday.rpy:34
translate ptbr monday_9b541779:

    # "Even with a few people there, it's still pretty quiet, aside from the train horns, and it's kind of eerie."
    "Mesmo com umas poucas pessoas por lá, ainda é tudo muito quieto, tirando as buzinas dos trens, e isso dá um ar meio sinistro."

# game/Monday.rpy:35
translate ptbr monday_65815bee:

    # "I wrap up and start to quickly make my way back."
    "Termino tudo e começo a voltar rápido pro pessoal."

# game/Monday.rpy:36
translate ptbr monday_20c174c3:

    # "It's hard to explain why I'm getting freaked out in broad daylight with people around."
    "É difícil explicar por que eu tô ficando com medo em plena luz do dia e com pessoas por perto."

# game/Monday.rpy:37
translate ptbr monday_5d205f5b:

    # "Either it's because of what happened all those years ago, or I'm just psyching myself out."
    "Ou é por causa do que aconteceu todos aqueles anos atrás, ou eu tô só criando paranóia na minha própria cabeça."

# game/Monday.rpy:39
translate ptbr monday_004df7ed:

    # "I'm glad to hear my friend's voices again as I get closer...Then again, it sounds like they're fighting."
    "Fico aliviado em ouvir as vozes dos meus amigos de novo conforme eu me aproximo... Por outro lado, parece que eles tão brigando."

# game/Monday.rpy:43
translate ptbr monday_9d91b031:

    # l "\"-been acting like a dick all day.\""
    l "\"-agindo feito um cuzão o dia inteiro.\""

# game/Monday.rpy:44
translate ptbr monday_2d0b0b96:

    # f "\"Be glad I came here at all.\""
    f "\"Agradeça que eu ainda vim pra cá.\""

# game/Monday.rpy:45
translate ptbr monday_6b6fa79b:

    # j "\"Apparently it would have been better if you hadn't.\""
    j "\"Pelo visto, teria sido melhor se não tivesse vindo mesmo.\""

# game/Monday.rpy:46
translate ptbr monday_b8fc4749:

    # f "\"Maybe I should just fuckin' leave, then?\""
    f "\"Talvez eu devesse só meter o pé logo daqui então?\""

# game/Monday.rpy:47
translate ptbr monday_2afb586b:

    # "It sounds a lot more serious than our usual squabbles, so I quicken my pace."
    "Isso parece bem mais sério que as nossas briguinhas de sempre, então eu aperto o passo."

# game/Monday.rpy:48
translate ptbr monday_767ce873:

    # "They seem to quiet down a bit once they see me coming."
    "Eles parecem dar uma acalmada quando me veem chegando."

# game/Monday.rpy:49
translate ptbr monday_168b447b:

    # "TJ's off to the side, looking out over the river, occasionally throwing a rock into it."
    "O TJ tá ali num canto, olhando pro rio, tacando uma pedra nele de vez em quando."

# game/Monday.rpy:50
translate ptbr monday_046a6d3f:

    # "Carl sits in a lawn chair, one of six that have been set out in a semi-circle."
    "O Carl tá sentado numa cadeira de praia, uma das seis que tão arrumadas em um semicírculo."

# game/Monday.rpy:51
translate ptbr monday_9b13470d:

    # "He has his chin on a fist as he lazily stares at me."
    "Ele tá com o queixo apoiado no punho, olhando pra mim com uma cara de preguiça."

# game/Monday.rpy:52
translate ptbr monday_57b8d036:

    # "Jenna and Leo both stand next to each other, looking at Flynn who's got his back turned, rummaging through the cooler."
    "A Jenna e o Leo tão parados um do lado do outro, olhando pro Flynn, que tá de costas, fuçando no isopor."

# game/Monday.rpy:53
translate ptbr monday_86d22b72:

    # m "\"Hey, what's wrong?\""
    m "\"Ei, o que foi?\""

# game/Monday.rpy:56
translate ptbr monday_c78c30ed:

    # "Leo sighs."
    "O Leo suspira."

# game/Monday.rpy:57
translate ptbr monday_46b40eff:

    # l "\"Nothing, you get your film?\""
    l "\"Nada não, conseguiu as suas imagens?\""

# game/Monday.rpy:58
translate ptbr monday_1a7cdc70:

    # m "\"Uh, yeah, got it...\""
    m "\"Ah, sim, consegui...\""

# game/Monday.rpy:59
translate ptbr monday_5fa31d3c:

    # "The silence is still awkward, and I have no idea what the hell to do with myself."
    "O silêncio continua constrangedor, e eu não tenho a menor ideia do que diabos eu faço agora."

# game/Monday.rpy:60
translate ptbr monday_a09498f0:

    # "I finally realize that I'm still holding the camera and decide to put that away."
    "Finalmente percebo que ainda tô segurando a câmera e decido guardar ela."

# game/Monday.rpy:61
translate ptbr monday_02c3eab3:

    # m "\"Hey, uh, I'm gonna go for a quick swim. Haven't been in water in a while.\""
    m "\"Aí, eh, eu vou dar um mergulho rápido. Faz um tempinho que não entro na água.\""

# game/Monday.rpy:62
translate ptbr monday_861d6216:

    # "When we first got here I was completely disappointed to find that the motel didn't have its own swimming pool."
    "Quando a gente chegou aqui, fiquei mó decepcionado quando descobri que o motel não tinha piscina."

# game/Monday.rpy:63
translate ptbr monday_41570ac0:

    # "Being an otter, I usually like to swim at LEAST once a day, if not more."
    "Sendo uma lontra, eu gosto de nadar PELO MENOS uma vez por dia, se não mais."

# game/Monday.rpy:64
translate ptbr monday_ae652625:

    # "It's been three days, and I'm feeling antsy as hell for it.."
    "Já fazem três dias, e eu tô agoniado pra caramba por causa disso..."

# game/Monday.rpy:65
translate ptbr monday_a551ecd8:

    # "Flynn finally turns around, a beer in his hand as he cracks it open."
    "O Flynn finalmente se vira pra gente, estalando pra abrir a lata de cerveja que tá na mão dele."

# game/Monday.rpy:66
translate ptbr monday_11b8873f:

    # "It was true that he'd been acting a bit strange today."
    "É verdade que ele andava meio estranho hoje."

# game/Monday.rpy:67
translate ptbr monday_b07e0c95:

    # "He'd held the entire trip up by a few hours, and when he'd finally shown up his eyes were bleary, and he seemed sluggish, like he'd been up all night."
    "Ele atrasou a nossa viagem inteira em umas horas, e quando finalmente apareceu, tava com os olhos pesados e meio lerdo, como se tivesse virado a noite acordado."

# game/Monday.rpy:68
translate ptbr monday_845231a1:

    # "When we'd asked if he was alright, he brushed us off."
    "Quando perguntamos se ele tava bem, ele só deu um fora na gente."

# game/Monday.rpy:71
translate ptbr monday_768f93bf:

    # f "\"Yeah, thanks for the help setting up, Chase. You're about as useful as this fatass here.\""
    f "\"Pois é, valeu pela ajuda pra arrumar as coisas, Chase. Você é tão útil quanto esse gordo aqui.\""

# game/Monday.rpy:72
translate ptbr monday_625dbafc:

    # "He swings the paw holding the beer at Carl."
    "Ele aponta a pata que tá segurando a cerveja pro Carl."

# game/Monday.rpy:73
translate ptbr monday_834f6db5:

    # l "\"Flynn.\""
    l ""

# game/Monday.rpy:74
translate ptbr monday_19ae4809:

    # f "\"So enjoy that swim while I set everything out.\""
    f ""

# game/Monday.rpy:75
translate ptbr monday_eb46438c:

    # m "\"Yeah, I will. Make my soda a diet, while you're at it.\""
    m ""

# game/Monday.rpy:76
translate ptbr monday_4650714b:

    # "I've had it with Flynn. He's souring the trip with his need to be an asshole."
    "Eu já tô de saco cheio do Flynn. Ele tá estragando a viagem com essa necessidade dele de ser um cuzão."

# game/Monday.rpy:78
translate ptbr monday_b8a20c31:

    # f "\"Go fuck yourself.\""
    f "\"Vai se foder.\""

# game/Monday.rpy:79
translate ptbr monday_daabbcaa:

    # "I ignore him as I strip off my shirt and head to the river bank."
    "Eu ignoro ele enquanto tiro a minha camisa e vou pra margem do rio."

# game/Monday.rpy:83
translate ptbr monday_637b34d3:

    # "I pat TJ on the shoulder as I pass him before slipping into the water."
    "Eu dou um tapinha no ombro do TJ quando passo por ele antes de escorregar pra dentro da água."

# game/Monday.rpy:84
translate ptbr monday_67056415:

    # "We're currently in the middle of a drought that has lasted the past three years, so the water is low...only about ten feet at its deepest."
    "A gente tá no meio de uma seca que já dura uns três anos, então a água tá baixa... só uns três metros na parte mais funda."

# game/Monday.rpy:85
translate ptbr monday_09a5490a:

    # "It's enough though and God.. it feels good. It's spring, so the water is pretty cold."
    "Mas é o suficiente e meu Deus.. é muito bom. É primavera, então a água tá bem gelada."

# game/Monday.rpy:87
translate ptbr monday_c1fb6e2a:

    # "I swim back and forth a few times before finally diving in."
    "Eu nado de um lado pro outro algumas vezes antes de finalmente mergulhar."

# game/Monday.rpy:92
translate ptbr monday_dcd5d9dc:

    # "Eventually I settle on drifting to the bottom, laying and gripping on to the rocky floor as I stare up at the shimmery light above me."
    "Por fim, eu deixo meu corpo afundar, me deitando e me segurando no fundo rochoso enquanto encaro a luz cintilante lá em cima."

# game/Monday.rpy:93
translate ptbr monday_cd0c5c5f:

    # "I feel the gentle current run over my body."
    "Eu sinto a correnteza suave passar pelo meu corpo."

# game/Monday.rpy:94
translate ptbr monday_fdfe9064:

    # "It's nice to be away from all that tension above me. I feel isolated, alone, and for now, that feels good."
    "É bom ficar longe de toda aquela tensão lá em cima. Eu me sinto isolado, sozinho, e por enquanto, isso é bom."

# game/Monday.rpy:95
translate ptbr monday_4bacac70:

    # "Only I could really come down this deep, the others not being able to hold their breath as long, or being too little."
    "Só eu conseguia descer tão fundo, os outros não conseguiam segurar a respiração por tanto tempo, ou eram muito pequenos."

# game/Monday.rpy:96
translate ptbr monday_a3b3563c:

    # "I remember when we were younger I would give the others \"rides\" around the lake, able to swim for nearly half a mile and back."
    "Eu lembro que quando a gente era mais novo eu dava \"caronas\" pros outros pelo lago, conseguindo nadar por quase um quilômetro ida e volta."

# game/Monday.rpy:97
translate ptbr monday_a7895d97:

    # "Even Flynn the asshole had done it a few times. It was one skill I had that I was proud of, even if it was inherent to my species."
    "Até o cuzão do Flynn fez isso algumas vezes. Era uma habilidade que eu tinha orgulho, mesmo que fosse inerente à minha espécie."

# game/Monday.rpy:98
translate ptbr monday_ddeff685:

    # "It still made me somehow useful or at least different from everyone else...in a good way."
    "Ainda me fazia ser um pouco útil ou pelo menos diferente de todo mundo... de um jeito bom."

# game/Monday.rpy:99
translate ptbr monday_f4f3ce6b:

    # "I had always felt like the odd one out in the group, as strange as it sounds."
    "Sempre me senti como o diferentão do grupo, por mais estranho que pareça."

# game/Monday.rpy:100
translate ptbr monday_b9387a15:

    # "Where everyone else has a strong, distinct personality, I was just.. average?"
    "Onde todo mundo tem uma personalidade forte, bem distinta, eu era só... normal?"

# game/Monday.rpy:101
translate ptbr monday_31bd8077:

    # "Sometimes I wonder if they were just friends with me because we all had to be when we were younger."
    "Às vezes eu me pergunto se eles só eram meus amigos porque todos nós tínhamos que ser quando a gente era mais novo."

# game/Monday.rpy:102
translate ptbr monday_d59a84e1:

    # "This whole trip has kinda forced me to think back on all the memories I have of this place, and my friends."
    "Essa viagem inteira meio que me forçou a pensar em todas as memórias que eu tenho desse lugar, e dos meus amigos."

# game/Monday.rpy:103
translate ptbr monday_e324ac2e:

    # "They were always doing the cool things, being different, while I just sort of blended into the background."
    "Eles sempre tavam fazendo as coisas legais, sendo diferentes, enquanto eu meio que só me misturava com o plano de fundo."

# game/Monday.rpy:104
translate ptbr monday_a7a170fc:

    # "Even then I wanted to DO something, to stand out somehow..."
    "Até naquela época eu queria FAZER alguma coisa, me destacar de algum jeito..."

# game/Monday.rpy:105
translate ptbr monday_7223c28d:

    # "That's...that's what I'm trying to do here...I guess..."
    "É... é isso que eu tô tentando fazer aqui... eu acho..."

# game/Monday.rpy:106
translate ptbr monday_57a34b10:

    # "It's been about seven minutes, and I only know that because that's about as long as I can hold my breath."
    "Já se passaram uns sete minutos, e eu só sei disso porque é o tempo máximo que consigo segurar minha respiração."

# game/Monday.rpy:108
translate ptbr monday_6e986b02:

    # "I decide I should go back up and help out, so I slowly let myself float back up towards the surface, trying to stay in the same spot."
    "Eu decido que devia subir de volta pra ajudar, então eu vou me deixando boiar lentamente em direção à superfície, tentando ficar no mesmo lugar."

# game/Monday.rpy:112
translate ptbr monday_6b4ed2c9:

    # "When I surface it's pretty quiet."
    "Quando chego na superfície tá bem quieto."

# game/Monday.rpy:113
translate ptbr monday_8d9f518e:

    # "For a second, I wonder if everyone is just gone."
    "Por um segundo, me pergunto se todo mundo simplesmente foi embora."

# game/Monday.rpy:114
translate ptbr monday_f9cd7b36:

    # "Of course, that's ridiculous and, as I come over the embankment, everyone's there."
    "Claro, isso é ridículo e, conforme eu subo o barranco, tá todo mundo lá."

# game/Monday.rpy:115
translate ptbr monday_aead5ad3:

    # "Predictably, Flynn didn't get my food out, so I go to the cooler to grab a sandwich and soda before sitting in an empty chair next to Leo."
    "Como era de se esperar, o Flynn não pegou minha comida, então eu vou até o isopor pegar um sanduíche e um refri antes de me sentar numa cadeira vazia do lado do Leo."

# game/Monday.rpy:116
translate ptbr monday_4ccf7106:

    # "Apparently it was a good idea to bring lawn chairs, considering the tables looked like they were covered in a year's worth of bird shit."
    "Pelo visto foi uma boa ideia trazer cadeiras de praia, considerando que as mesas pareciam cobertas por um ano inteiro de bosta de passarinho."

# game/Monday.rpy:117
translate ptbr monday_9e3b3eab:

    # f "\"How was the swim?\""
    f "\"Como foi o mergulho?\""

# game/Monday.rpy:118
translate ptbr monday_d3552978:

    # "His tone is bitter and salty."
    "O tom dele é amargo e ressentido."

# game/Monday.rpy:119
translate ptbr monday_ea580f04:

    # "He's not in his usual grumpy, but good-natured mood. He's genuinely unhappy."
    "Ele não tá no seu clima de sempre, rabugento, mas de bom humor. Ele tá genuinamente infeliz."

# game/Monday.rpy:120
translate ptbr monday_f31d3ba1:

    # "What the hell was his deal?"
    "Qual é a porra do problema dele?"

# game/Monday.rpy:121
translate ptbr monday_ee8193f9:

    # m "\"Amazing, I'm gonna have to come back here again sometime during the week.\""
    m "\"Incrível, eu vou ter que voltar aqui de novo alguma hora durante a semana.\""

# game/Monday.rpy:122
translate ptbr monday_68481c6a:

    # m "\"You lizard people don't understand, you hardly ever need water!\""
    m ""

# game/Monday.rpy:126
translate ptbr monday_71b9e7bb:

    # l "\"It always scares the hell out of me when you're down there that long.\""
    l ""

# game/Monday.rpy:127
translate ptbr monday_b5f5e714:

    # m "\"I'm built for it.\""
    m ""

# game/Monday.rpy:132
translate ptbr monday_38c3fb60:

    # t "\"Remember when you'd give us rides? That was fun.\""
    t ""

# game/Monday.rpy:133
translate ptbr monday_2630683b:

    # c "\"Remember when you'd always scream like a girl when Chase would go out too far out?\""
    c ""

# game/Monday.rpy:134
translate ptbr monday_5b0c3aa6:

    # m "\"Oh wow, I remember that now.\""
    m ""

# game/Monday.rpy:135
translate ptbr monday_feb11bcf:

    # t "\"Hey! I've never really liked water.\""
    t ""

# game/Monday.rpy:136
translate ptbr monday_fb7bd8ea:

    # t "\"Anyway, Chase would do it on purpose. He knew I didn't like it out to a certain point.\""
    t ""

# game/Monday.rpy:137
translate ptbr monday_23b3c2a4:

    # "Carl looks at me."
    "O Carl olha pra mim."

# game/Monday.rpy:138
translate ptbr monday_d60449e0:

    # c "\"You know what was really cool was when you'd take us down for a dive.\""
    c ""

# game/Monday.rpy:143
translate ptbr monday_ff6d76eb:

    # j "\"Oh yeah! Chase was like our own little submarine.\""
    j ""

# game/Monday.rpy:144
translate ptbr monday_6576c56d:

    # "I'm starting to get that \"otters are swimming clowns\" vibe again. Still, I kind of enjoy the attention."
    "Tô começando a sentir de novo aquela vibe de \"lontras são palhaços nadadores\". Mesmo assim, eu meio que gosto da atenção."

# game/Monday.rpy:145
translate ptbr monday_4a6a7f6e:

    # l "\"We'd get you to take us to the bottom so we could look for 'treasure'.\""
    l ""

# game/Monday.rpy:146
translate ptbr monday_26f6aef9:

    # "Leo makes air quotes around the last word."
    "O Leo faz aspas no ar com os dedos na última palavra."

# game/Monday.rpy:147
translate ptbr monday_78f69412:

    # m "\"And you know, we probably would have found way more stuff if you guys hadn't been dragging me down. I remember when-\""
    m ""

# game/Monday.rpy:150
translate ptbr monday_2e5c4de8:

    # f "\"Are we really fucking talking about this?\""
    f ""

# game/Monday.rpy:154
translate ptbr monday_39fa945c:

    # "Everyone turns to look at Flynn."
    "Todo mundo se vira pra olhar pro Flynn."

# game/Monday.rpy:155
translate ptbr monday_8f2cd1d9:

    # "His voice is low and dangerous."
    "A voz dele é baixa e perigosa."

# game/Monday.rpy:156
translate ptbr monday_e32fb98e:

    # "There's a chill in the air because we all know what he means."
    "Fica um clima tenso no ar porque todos nós sabemos o que ele quer dizer."

# game/Monday.rpy:157
translate ptbr monday_c1fb1003:

    # "I was actually feeling pretty good about it at this point, like we crossed a bridge, being able to talk about it for once."
    "Eu, na verdade, tava me sentindo muito bem com isso a esse ponto, como se tivéssemos cruzado uma ponte, conseguindo falar sobre isso pelo menos uma vez."

# game/Monday.rpy:158
translate ptbr monday_54cce6e5:

    # "Apparently, we hadn't."
    "Pelo visto, a gente não tinha."

# game/Monday.rpy:159
translate ptbr monday_834f6db5_1:

    # l "\"Flynn.\""
    l ""

# game/Monday.rpy:160
translate ptbr monday_ca7dc35f:

    # f "\"No, I'm serious.\""
    f ""

# game/Monday.rpy:161
translate ptbr monday_5abc8e98:

    # f "\"Do you think it's okay to fucking talk about this when the lake is just a quarter mile that way?\""
    f ""

# game/Monday.rpy:163
translate ptbr monday_20b84323:

    # j "\"You know what, Flynn, I think we should. Isn't that part of the reason why we're here?\""
    j ""

# game/Monday.rpy:164
translate ptbr monday_33e29150:

    # f "\"NO! If that were the case, we'd be over THERE, but we're HERE! And why is that?\""
    f ""

# game/Monday.rpy:165
translate ptbr monday_cd261e38:

    # "Everyone's quiet for a moment. I see TJ shrink into his chair, staring hard at his lap."
    "Todo mundo fica em silêncio por um momento. Eu vejo o TJ se encolher na cadeira, olhando fixamente pro próprio colo."

# game/Monday.rpy:166
translate ptbr monday_07a42a5d:

    # l "\"Flynn, we came here because Chase needed footage.\""
    l ""

# game/Monday.rpy:169
translate ptbr monday_f5d01cd8:

    # "A change comes over Flynn. His face darkens, and everyone senses it."
    "Uma mudança toma conta do Flynn. O rosto dele escurece, e todo mundo sente isso."

# game/Monday.rpy:170
translate ptbr monday_b8da6f61:

    # "Flynn turns to me, and it takes some effort not to flinch back."
    "O Flynn se vira pra mim, e preciso fazer um certo esforço pra não recuar."

# game/Monday.rpy:171
translate ptbr monday_aab8ed98:

    # f "\"Yeah, and why's that Chase? You gonna put THAT in your fuckin' documentary?\""
    f ""

# game/Monday.rpy:172
translate ptbr monday_d37e31fb:

    # m "\"No! I-I...Emma Lake is an important part of Echo's history, I just...\""
    m ""

# game/Monday.rpy:173
translate ptbr monday_29516a10:

    # f "\"Just what?\""
    f ""

# game/Monday.rpy:174
translate ptbr monday_49466fe0:

    # "Flynn raises his brow ridge at me, and finally I just lower my eyes."
    "O Flynn arqueia a sobrancelha pra mim, e finalmente eu só abaixo os olhos."

# game/Monday.rpy:175
translate ptbr monday_d2c93d76:

    # f "\"This was a stupid fuckin' idea.\""
    f ""

# game/Monday.rpy:176
translate ptbr monday_8c91caa8:

    # j "\"You know what, Flynn? If you'd be a little more open, tell us what's on your mind, we'd be able to avoid a lot of this kind of stuff.\""
    j ""

# game/Monday.rpy:177
translate ptbr monday_e94ed1a2:

    # f "\"Oh, you wanna know what's on my mind?\""
    f ""

# game/Monday.rpy:178
translate ptbr monday_828b8c0b:

    # "Flynn swivels and marches up to Carl."
    "O Flynn dá meia-volta e marcha até o Carl."

# game/Monday.rpy:185
translate ptbr monday_40157fcc:

    # f "\"Alright, let's start with you. You're fat, lazy, no motivation, no future.\""
    f ""

# game/Monday.rpy:186
translate ptbr monday_b6faf705:

    # f "\"What the hell are you planning on doing with your life?\""
    f ""

# game/Monday.rpy:188
translate ptbr monday_9e938693:

    # f "\"Sit here, waste away in Echo, moochin' off your parents until you're dead?\""
    f ""

# game/Monday.rpy:189
translate ptbr monday_9eeafee3:

    # "Carl stares back up at Flynn impassively, though he hunches in on himself a bit further."
    "O Carl encara o Flynn impassível, embora ele se encolha ainda mais um pouco."

# game/Monday.rpy:190
translate ptbr monday_7ad01676:

    # j "\"Flynn, don't do this right now...\""
    j ""

# game/Monday.rpy:198
translate ptbr monday_7ce31bdd:

    # f "\"And you, thinkin' you're better than everyone else. I can tell, you think everyone in Echo is trash.\""
    f ""

# game/Monday.rpy:199
translate ptbr monday_29e30295:

    # f "\"Just because me and the others haven't left you think we're lower than you. Just because we don't have an education, we're a bunch of retards.\""
    f ""

# game/Monday.rpy:200
translate ptbr monday_04ee003b:

    # f "\"Yeah? Well you left your whole fuckin' family behind without even sayin' goodbye.\""
    f ""

# game/Monday.rpy:201
translate ptbr monday_1a5a20ef:

    # f "\"You know what's even goin' on with 'em right now, what they're dealin' with?\""
    f ""

# game/Monday.rpy:202
translate ptbr monday_4a62a343:

    # f "\"Yeah, real fuckin' hero you are.\""
    f ""

# game/Monday.rpy:204
translate ptbr monday_32f51c18:

    # j "\"You think I—\""
    j ""

# game/Monday.rpy:206
translate ptbr monday_bec8d75a:

    # l "\"Stop it, Flynn.\""
    l "\"Para com isso, Flynn.\""

# game/Monday.rpy:207
translate ptbr monday_03a90c1e:

    # f "\"Ah, our unquestionable leader. We wouldn't have been friends without you, would we?\""
    f "\"Ah, nosso líder inquestionável. Não teríamos sido amigos sem você, teríamos?\""

# game/Monday.rpy:208
translate ptbr monday_8ab307c4:

    # f "\"That's why you brought us here, right, so we could all bond?\""
    f "\"Foi por isso que você nos trouxe aqui, certo, para que pudéssemos nos aproximar?\""

# game/Monday.rpy:209
translate ptbr monday_827e3e33:

    # f "\"Or...wait, was it just because you wanted to get into Chase's pants?\""
    f "\"Ou... peraí, foi só porque você queria entrar nas calças do Chase?\""

# game/Monday.rpy:211
translate ptbr monday_4229db71:

    # "Leo's ears fall flat."
    "As orelhas do Leo abaixam."

# game/Monday.rpy:212
translate ptbr monday_9171db40:

    # f "\"Probably. You've been a mess ever since he left, so let me be the one to tell you:\""
    f "\"Provavelmente. Você tá uma bagunça desde que ele foi embora, então me deixa ser o único a te dizer:\""

# game/Monday.rpy:213
translate ptbr monday_fdf7f0dd:

    # f "\"IT'S OVER.\""
    f "\"ACABOU.\""

# game/Monday.rpy:214
translate ptbr monday_d1f3381d:

    # f "\"It's fuckin' unhealthy, you're obsessed with him!\""
    f "\"Isso não é nada saudável, porra, você é obcecado por ele!\""

# game/Monday.rpy:215
translate ptbr monday_1660013f:

    # "Slowly, his head turns to me, and I brace myself."
    "Lentamente, a cabeça dele se vira pra mim, e eu me preparo."

# game/Monday.rpy:216
translate ptbr monday_2cb83a6a:

    # f "\"And I can't imagine why...\""
    f "\"E eu não consigo imaginar o porquê...\""

# game/Monday.rpy:217
translate ptbr monday_5ce5c811:

    # f "\"You, Chase, have the personality of a fuckin' rock. I wish you could see yourself.\""
    f "\"Você, Chase, tem a personalidade de uma porra de uma pedra. Queria que você pudesse se ver.\""

# game/Monday.rpy:218
translate ptbr monday_e663811d:

    # f "\"You just sit there like a creep, watching everyone, weighing everything that we say.\""
    f "\"Você só fica aí sentado que nem um esquisito, observando todo mundo, medindo tudo o que a gente diz.\""

# game/Monday.rpy:219
translate ptbr monday_bbe11725:

    # f "\"And don't think I haven't caught the way you stare at all of us, like we're all objects to be collected.\""
    f "\"E não ache que eu não percebi o jeito que você encara a todos nós, como se fôssemos objetos pra serem colecionados.\""

# game/Monday.rpy:220
translate ptbr monday_b347f166:

    # f "\"What, are you just planning to cycle through all of us for sex?\""
    f "\"O que, você tá planejando fazer um rodízio com todos nós pra sexo?\""

# game/Monday.rpy:221
translate ptbr monday_4965c0da:

    # f "\"Sure seems like it.\""
    f "\"Até que parece.\""

# game/Monday.rpy:222
translate ptbr monday_5e84d690:

    # "Flynn stops, then exhales. It seems like it's over, I really hope it is."
    "O Flynn para, e então solta o ar. Parece que acabou, eu realmente espero que sim."

# game/Monday.rpy:223
translate ptbr monday_8eab2d45:

    # "That proves futile, though, as Flynn turns slowly on TJ."
    "Isso se prova inútil, no entanto, enquanto o Flynn se vira lentamente pro TJ."

# game/Monday.rpy:225
translate ptbr monday_7b4fd886:

    # "I had silently prayed that the lynx would make a run for it while Flynn had all his attention focused on us, but TJ looks apathetic."
    "Eu tinha rezado silenciosamente pra que o lince saísse correndo enquanto o Flynn tinha toda a sua atenção voltada pra gente, mas o TJ parece apático."

# game/Monday.rpy:226
translate ptbr monday_28db9cc7:

    # "Like a statue, like there's no soul in him."
    "Como uma estátua, como se não houvesse alma nele."

# game/Monday.rpy:227
translate ptbr monday_7a04330f:

    # "Flynn pauses, though, as if he's at a loss for what to say."
    "O Flynn faz uma pausa, no entanto, como se não soubesse o que dizer."

# game/Monday.rpy:228
translate ptbr monday_97f0c146:

    # "Finally..."
    "Finalmente..."

# game/Monday.rpy:229
translate ptbr monday_475255d6:

    # f "\"What happened, TJ?\""
    f "\"O que aconteceu, TJ?\""

# game/Monday.rpy:230
translate ptbr monday_834f6db5_2:

    # l "\"Flynn.\""
    l "\"Flynn.\""

# game/Monday.rpy:231
translate ptbr monday_8344f23f:

    # "Leo stands up, and from his posture, I can tell the wolf is ready to fight."
    "O Leo se levanta, e pela postura dele, posso dizer que o lobo tá pronto pra brigar."

# game/Monday.rpy:232
translate ptbr monday_bd34ae68:

    # "Memories are starting to flow back...TJ, Flynn thinking he'd done something...something to—"
    "Memórias começam a voltar... TJ, o Flynn achando que ele tinha feito alguma coisa... alguma coisa com—"

# game/Monday.rpy:233
translate ptbr monday_cf714c0f:

    # "I stand up, as well."
    "Eu me levanto também."

# game/Monday.rpy:234
translate ptbr monday_15f4d8b3:

    # "Flynn may sound like a hardass, but physically Leo had him beat...easily."
    "O Flynn pode soar como um valentão, mas fisicamente o Leo ganha dele... fácil."

# game/Monday.rpy:235
translate ptbr monday_b7325766:

    # "Flynn can obviously tell that he might have a fight on his hands, though, and it's clear he doesn't want that."
    "O Flynn obviamente sabe que pode ter uma briga nas mãos, no entanto, e fica claro que ele não quer isso."

# game/Monday.rpy:236
translate ptbr monday_7e2730a0:

    # "He drops his shoulders, seeming to shrink, as if invisible strings that had been holding him up were cut. He turns to us, then gestures at TJ."
    "Ele abaixa os ombros, parecendo encolher, como se cordas invisíveis que o seguravam tivessem sido cortadas. Ele se vira pra gente, então aponta pro TJ."

# game/Monday.rpy:237
translate ptbr monday_7ee37983:

    # f "\"I just want the truth. Can we just put a stop to this today, right now?\""
    f "\"Eu só quero a verdade. Podemos dar um fim nisso hoje, agora mesmo?\""

# game/Monday.rpy:238
translate ptbr monday_16f87a38:

    # f "\"I don't think you know how much of a nightmare this has been for me, not really knowing...TJ—\""
    f "\"Eu não acho que vocês saibam o pesadelo que isso tem sido pra mim, não saber de verdade... TJ—\""

# game/Monday.rpy:239
translate ptbr monday_ac3a1e7a:

    # "TJ stares up at Flynn, muzzle set grimly."
    "O TJ olha pro Flynn, com o focinho sério."

# game/Monday.rpy:240
translate ptbr monday_b197f842:

    # f "\"What happened to Sydney?\""
    f "\"O que aconteceu com o Sydney?\""

# game/Monday.rpy:241
translate ptbr monday_0bbabb86:

    # "It's dead quiet. TJ stares at his lap, not moving."
    "Tá um silêncio mortal. O TJ encara o próprio colo, sem se mexer."

# game/Monday.rpy:242
translate ptbr monday_79795187:

    # m "\"Come on, let's—\""
    m "\"Qual é, vamos—\""

# game/Monday.rpy:243
translate ptbr monday_d0b2fc8e:

    # "Flynn holds up a hand towards me, still staring at TJ."
    "O Flynn levanta uma mão pra mim, ainda encarando o TJ."

# game/Monday.rpy:244
translate ptbr monday_747318bf:

    # "Slowly, TJ looks up, his face still stoic, still made of stone."
    "Lentamente, o TJ levanta o olhar, com o rosto ainda estoico, ainda feito de pedra."

# game/Monday.rpy:245
translate ptbr monday_498c8275:

    # t "\"I already told you what happened...\""
    t "\"Eu já te disse o que aconteceu...\""

# game/Monday.rpy:246
translate ptbr monday_4c0af0b9:

    # f "\"Bullshit!\""
    f "\"Mentira!\""

# game/Monday.rpy:247
translate ptbr monday_17652aa2:

    # "Flynn steps forward, but Leo's there to grab the back of Flynn's shirt and swing him around."
    "O Flynn dá um passo à frente, mas o Leo tá lá pra agarrar a parte de trás da camisa do Flynn e o jogar pro lado."

# game/Monday.rpy:257
translate ptbr monday_d90a6a47:

    # "I dodge out of the way as Flynn is flung back to land on his ass, kicking up a big cloud of dust."
    "Eu desvio do caminho quando o Flynn é arremessado pra trás e cai de bunda, levantando uma grande nuvem de poeira."

# game/Monday.rpy:258
translate ptbr monday_84707691:

    # f "\"Shit!\""
    f "\"Merda!\""

# game/Monday.rpy:261
translate ptbr monday_cd7804dc:

    # l "\"Flynn, I swear to god, if you start a fight here I'll drop your stupid ass!\""
    l "\"Flynn, eu juro por Deus, se você começar uma briga aqui eu vou te deitar na porrada!\""

# game/Monday.rpy:262
translate ptbr monday_c836a45b:

    # "Everyone except TJ is standing now, staring at Flynn."
    "Todo mundo exceto o TJ tá de pé agora, encarando o Flynn."

# game/Monday.rpy:263
translate ptbr monday_7257811d:

    # "Flynn sits there, glaring up at Leo, obviously weighing his chances."
    "O Flynn continua sentado, encarando o Leo de volta, obviamente medindo as chances dele."

# game/Monday.rpy:264
translate ptbr monday_172a9844:

    # "He seems to come up short, though, as he spits to the side and stands up, brushing off his pants as he turns away."
    "Ele parece recuar, no entanto, cuspindo pro lado e se levantando, espanando as calças enquanto dá as costas."

# game/Monday.rpy:267
translate ptbr monday_3c06404d:

    # f "\"You're all okay with not knowing? Fuck all of you.\""
    f "\"Vocês todos tão de boa em não saber? Fodam-se todos vocês.\""

# game/Monday.rpy:268
translate ptbr monday_84ca9917:

    # "He turns back around, hands in his pockets, a bitter look on his face."
    "Ele se vira de novo, mãos nos bolsos, um olhar amargo no rosto."

# game/Monday.rpy:269
translate ptbr monday_2b5642a9:

    # f "\"This whole thing was stupid, Leo. We're not even friends anymore.\""
    f "\"Isso tudo foi estúpido, Leo. A gente não é nem mais amigo.\""

# game/Monday.rpy:272
translate ptbr monday_e63eaa2d:

    # "Flynn scuffs the ground before turning and walking towards the trail that goes back to Echo."
    "O Flynn raspa o pé no chão antes de virar e andar em direção à trilha que volta pra Echo."

# game/Monday.rpy:273
translate ptbr monday_aec4fe22:

    # l "\"Goddammit, Flynn!\""
    l "\"Puta que pariu, Flynn!\""

# game/Monday.rpy:274
translate ptbr monday_565bca34:

    # f "\"Fuck off...\""
    f "\"Vai se foder...\""

# game/Monday.rpy:275
translate ptbr monday_24d3d185:

    # "Flynn keeps walking and it's pretty clear that he isn't coming back."
    "O Flynn continua andando e tá bem claro que ele não vai voltar."

# game/Monday.rpy:278
translate ptbr monday_a7f9926d:

    # "I raise a paw and rub it over my eyes. What was he doing?"
    "Eu levanto uma pata e esfrego nos olhos. O que ele tava fazendo?"

# game/Monday.rpy:279
translate ptbr monday_94f4d97d:

    # "He's a...passionate guy that will sometimes just explode with all his insecurities before running away and hiding for a few days."
    "Ele é um... cara esquentado que às vezes simplesmente explode com todas as suas inseguranças antes de fugir e se esconder por alguns dias."

# game/Monday.rpy:280
translate ptbr monday_869bb094:

    # "He's skewered us all like that before, that was classic Flynn."
    "Ele já tinha nos atacado assim antes, isso era o clássico Flynn."

# game/Monday.rpy:281
translate ptbr monday_32f599af:

    # "But he was especially mean...dark."
    "Mas ele foi especialmente cruel... sombrio."

# game/Monday.rpy:282
translate ptbr monday_c47b8210:

    # "And the part with TJ...I vaguely remember Flynn having some sort of suspicion, but that had been a long time ago."
    "E a parte do TJ... Eu vagamente me lembro de o Flynn ter algum tipo de suspeita, mas isso já faz muito tempo."

# game/Monday.rpy:283
translate ptbr monday_0afe6ed8:

    # "Had he been sitting on that this whole time?"
    "Ele tinha guardado isso esse tempo todo?"

# game/Monday.rpy:284
translate ptbr monday_4a4d9255:

    # "I look to the left and see that TJ's gone."
    "Eu olho pra esquerda e vejo que o TJ sumiu."

# game/Monday.rpy:285
translate ptbr monday_9be0c68d:

    # "Carl's still sitting down, but now it looks like he's pulling out a joint."
    "O Carl continua sentado, mas agora parece que ele tá puxando um baseado."

# game/Monday.rpy:286
translate ptbr monday_f8348f51:

    # "Leo's walking off down another trail, cursing while Jenna follows him."
    "O Leo tá caminhando por outra trilha, xingando enquanto a Jenna segue ele."

# game/Monday.rpy:287
translate ptbr monday_2925ebd5:

    # "I stand there, next to my chair, undecided..."
    "Eu fico ali, do lado da minha cadeira, indeciso..."

